      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Tláloc era el dios de la lluvia y del rayo. Sin él no crecía el maíz.",
          "en": "Tlaloc was the god of rain and lightning. Without him, the maize would not grow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para los mexicas era tan importante que tenía uno de los dos templos de la cima del Templo Mayor.",
          "en": "He was so important to the Mexica that he had one of the two shrines on top of the Great Temple."
        },
        {
          "es": "En los códices es fácil de reconocer: lleva anillos alrededor de los ojos, y colmillos.",
          "en": "In the codices he is easy to spot: he has rings around his eyes, and fangs."
        },
        {
          "es": "Vivía en las montañas, donde nacen las nubes, con sus ayudantes, los tlaloques.",
          "en": "He lived in the mountains, where the clouds are born, with his helpers, the tlaloque."
        },
        {
          "es": "Un libro antiguo dice que guardaban la lluvia en grandes jarras. Cuando rompían una, sonaba el trueno.",
          "en": "One old book says they kept the rain in huge jars. When they broke one, thunder rang out."
        }
