        },
        {
          "es": "Otro libro, la Historia de los mexicanos por sus pinturas, dice que se convirtieron en aves.",
          "en": "Another book, the History of the Mexicans as Told by Their Paintings, says they became birds."
        },
        {
          "es": "El guajolote es un ave de México. Los mexicas lo criaban en sus casas.",
          "en": "The turkey is a bird from Mexico. The Mexica raised turkeys at home."
        },
        {
          "es": "Así, otra vez, la gente de una época se transformó en animales.",
          "en": "So once again, the people of an age were changed into animals."
        }
